1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Sixteenth  Episode
The Puppet Show
Tink and Colette

15
00:01:50,774 --> 00:01:53,904
Come on, step right up!

16
00:01:58,659 --> 00:02:00,600
Come on over, step right up!

17
00:02:00,820 --> 00:02:06,180
Old Man Anzoro is back again this year! It's Old Man Anzoro's puppet show!

18
00:02:10,024 --> 00:02:12,260
Step right up! Come on over!

19
00:02:12,740 --> 00:02:16,460
Old Man Azoro's puppet show is so much fun!

20
00:02:20,730 --> 00:02:23,500
Ah, so many people have gathered!

21
00:02:23,665 --> 00:02:26,320
It's Old Anthro's puppet show.

22
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:32,660
Huh? Everyone's making a fuss.

23
00:02:36,270 --> 00:02:38,313
What are they doing gathered over there?

24
00:02:39,140 --> 00:02:40,380
Is it a puppet show?

25
00:02:41,430 --> 00:02:44,080
Hey, are you asking why everyone's gathered?

26
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:48,100
It's Old Man Azoro's puppet show.

27
00:02:48,125 --> 00:02:49,280
It's really fun!

28
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:52,540
Wow, let me see too!

29
00:02:54,250 --> 00:02:58,460
Now, everyone, here's a greeting from our cute puppet, Colette!

30
00:02:58,920 --> 00:02:59,920
Colette?

31
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:09,960
Nice to meet you, I'm Colette!

32
00:03:12,055 --> 00:03:14,820
I'm so happy to meet you all.

33
00:03:15,109 --> 00:03:17,000
Please become my fans!

34
00:03:17,700 --> 00:03:20,000
I'm playing Snow White next time!

35
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:21,160
Make sure to watch!

36
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:24,028
What a cute little girl.

37
00:03:24,340 --> 00:03:29,280
Now then, "Snow White and the Giant Monster" is about to begin!

38
00:03:42,020 --> 00:03:46,200
Ooh!, she's the cutest thing ever! Wow!

39
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:55,888
Oh no! A monster is attacking to eat Snow White!

40
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:04,771
What will happen to Snow White? Will the monster eat her?

41
00:04:04,795 --> 00:04:07,855
Oh, don't say that! Show us more!

42
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:12,100
That's all for today! Bring money tomorrow, and I'll show you the rest.

43
00:04:12,225 --> 00:04:18,571
"Oh, poor Colette! Please be safe!" So bring money tomorrow, okay?

44
00:04:18,665 --> 00:04:20,560
Then I'll show you the rest!

45
00:04:51,710 --> 00:04:54,380
Ah, this is Old Man Anzoro's place.

46
00:04:55,325 --> 00:04:56,873
I wonder if Colette is here?

47
00:04:57,280 --> 00:04:59,900
I can't wait to see Colette as Snow White!

48
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:02,155
Don't worry, Colette.

49
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:05,280
No matter what monster shows up, you're safe with me!

50
00:05:05,820 --> 00:05:08,200
If one shows up, I won't let it off easy!

51
00:05:08,475 --> 00:05:10,900
I'll punch it, kick it, stomp on it, and ride on it!

52
00:05:11,610 --> 00:05:14,097
Who’s making such a racket at this hour? How annoying!

53
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:16,680
I'm sorry. Who on earth are you?

54
00:05:17,015 --> 00:05:18,800
I wanted to see Colette.

55
00:05:19,710 --> 00:05:21,220
What? Colette?

56
00:05:21,395 --> 00:05:24,520
No, no! You can't see her unless you bring money tomorrow!

57
00:05:24,665 --> 00:05:27,606
Hey, don't linger around here! Hurry up and go home!

58
00:05:41,050 --> 00:05:43,142
Making money sure isn't easy.

59
00:05:44,260 --> 00:05:47,240
Oh, my sweet money, I love you!

60
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,860
Mister, I'm hungry.

61
00:05:49,165 --> 00:05:51,446
I'm busy right now, so I can't hear you!

62
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:53,980
I carried ten cups of water!

63
00:05:54,460 --> 00:05:56,480
Okay, you can go home now.

64
00:05:57,295 --> 00:05:59,080
Give me the money like you promised.

65
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,733
What do you need money for anyway?

66
00:06:01,475 --> 00:06:02,764
To see a puppet show.

67
00:06:03,275 --> 00:06:04,600
Here, take it.

68
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:06,097
Is that all?

69
00:06:06,210 --> 00:06:07,581
Is this it?

70
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:09,968
Forget it! I hate greedy kids!

71
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:11,280
Shoo! Get lost!

72
00:06:11,635 --> 00:06:14,228
If you pick on me, I'll set a bulldog on you!

73
00:06:14,365 --> 00:06:15,420
Look out!

74
00:06:18,310 --> 00:06:20,760
Yay! I lied about the bulldog!

75
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:27,180
My sweet money, I'll never let you go again.

76
00:06:31,625 --> 00:06:35,115
Now, good night, my sweet money.

77
00:06:45,870 --> 00:06:48,230
Fast asleep, they are.

78
00:07:00,260 --> 00:07:01,753
Huh? What's this?

79
00:07:02,195 --> 00:07:06,120
Well, if it isn't little Mr. Money! You shouldn't be up this late at night.

80
00:07:06,270 --> 00:07:07,400
Now, be a good boy...

81
00:07:07,535 --> 00:07:08,900
Off to sleep you go.

82
00:07:11,786 --> 00:07:16,220
D-D-D... Do-re-mi-fa-so-la-ti... Thief! Thief!

83
00:07:16,260 --> 00:07:19,840
Somebody help! A thief!

84
00:07:37,530 --> 00:07:39,600
Heh, made a fortune today!

85
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:53,380
Nobody suspects that beloved Old Man Anzoro is actually a master thief!

86
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:57,060
And I raked in a bundle again tonight!

87
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:01,800
I've got the skill and the brains.

88
00:08:01,990 --> 00:08:06,660
I'll earn a fortune while I can, then live peacefully with my puppets!

89
00:08:08,355 --> 00:08:10,600
There, there, aren't you a cutie?

90
00:08:10,935 --> 00:08:12,493
You're a popular one, aren't you?

91
00:08:12,725 --> 00:08:17,580
Tomorrow, I'll use your white dress to rake in heaps of cash from the kids!

92
00:08:27,670 --> 00:08:28,670
Hey, it's Tink!

93
00:08:29,140 --> 00:08:30,780
They're doing a puppet show in town!

94
00:08:30,975 --> 00:08:32,559
It's super fun!

95
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:34,199
Wow, I wanna see it!

96
00:08:34,299 --> 00:08:35,299
What's it about?

97
00:08:35,689 --> 00:08:38,006
They're doing "Snow White and the Giant Monster"!

98
00:08:38,175 --> 00:08:39,620
It's awesome!

99
00:08:39,732 --> 00:08:41,233
Wow, how nice!

100
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:42,740
Come on, let's go!

101
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:44,740
But we don't have any money.

102
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:45,920
Oh, right.

103
00:08:46,260 --> 00:08:50,660
The puppet man won't let us watch unless we bring money.

104
00:08:51,491 --> 00:08:53,426
Isn't there some way?

105
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,940
We've got to find a way to go see it!

106
00:08:55,289 --> 00:08:57,240
There's this really wonderful puppet!

107
00:08:57,589 --> 00:09:00,093
Her name is Colette, and she's so cute.

108
00:09:00,270 --> 00:09:02,640
I fell for her right away!

109
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:07,386
No matter how much you like her, Tink, we still can't go.

110
00:09:07,630 --> 00:09:08,966
No, no, no!

111
00:09:09,030 --> 00:09:11,080
I'm definitely going!

112
00:09:20,909 --> 00:09:21,909
Uh-oh...

113
00:09:22,420 --> 00:09:23,420
Who's there?!

114
00:09:23,539 --> 00:09:24,780
Who threw that in here?!

115
00:09:25,250 --> 00:09:28,440
Uh-oh, it hit Dr. Uranari's room.

116
00:09:28,770 --> 00:09:31,900
Your Highness, you're taking your mischief a bit too far.

117
00:09:32,940 --> 00:09:39,533
Dear Doctor, please lend us some money! Please, please, please!

118
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:41,160
Money, you say?

119
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:43,400
You'll only waste it, Your Highness, so I cannot.

120
00:09:43,695 --> 00:09:46,873
Aww, don't say that! — When I say no, I mean no!

121
00:09:50,595 --> 00:09:51,479
Run! Run!

122
00:09:52,410 --> 00:09:53,840
Wait, Your Highness!

123
00:09:53,955 --> 00:09:54,955
Where are you hiding?!

124
00:09:55,125 --> 00:09:57,013
If we find them, they'll be punished!

125
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:04,293
Step right up, come on over!

126
00:10:04,555 --> 00:10:06,340
The puppet show is starting!

127
00:10:06,690 --> 00:10:11,800
Colette's 'Snow White and the Giant Monster' is about to begin!

128
00:10:13,106 --> 00:10:17,525
Step right up! Money, money, money, money! Pay your fee and hurry on inside!

129
00:10:17,549 --> 00:10:19,706
It's only one sen, so it's cheap!

130
00:10:20,635 --> 00:10:22,240
I want to see that.

131
00:10:22,515 --> 00:10:24,461
Come on, I want to see! I want to see! I want to see!

132
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:27,326
Tink, are you okay?!

133
00:10:28,529 --> 00:10:30,140
I have a good idea.

134
00:10:31,180 --> 00:10:31,740
Really?

135
00:10:31,879 --> 00:10:32,620
What's your plan?

136
00:10:32,885 --> 00:10:34,786
Listen, we're starting with this!

137
00:10:36,021 --> 00:10:38,899
<i>Today, just like every other day,
Princess Snow White has come into the woods...</i>

138
00:10:38,923 --> 00:10:40,179
<i>...to gather firewood.</i>

139
00:10:40,205 --> 00:10:45,489
<i>Oh, what a wonderful day!
Hello, little bird! How are you?</i>

140
00:10:45,514 --> 00:10:49,170
<i>Oh, those raspberries look
delicious! I'll pick some!</i>

141
00:10:49,221 --> 00:10:53,356
<i>What a beautiful little pond! I'll wash my face
in this clear, cool water!</i>

142
00:10:53,381 --> 00:10:55,953
If I show my face, they'll spot me.

143
00:10:57,090 --> 00:11:00,646
<i>Among the yellow flowers, a hideous monster suddenly appears!</i>

144
00:11:05,644 --> 00:11:06,314
Colette!

145
00:11:07,038 --> 00:11:11,599
<i>I'm going to eat the Princess!</i>

146
00:11:11,740 --> 00:11:13,686
<i>Help!</i>

147
00:11:13,944 --> 00:11:16,940
I told you, stay down! You're going to get us caught!

148
00:11:17,115 --> 00:11:19,920
Colette! The monster! This is terrible!

149
00:11:20,466 --> 00:11:22,119
It's only a play, isn't it?

150
00:11:22,193 --> 00:11:24,280
<i>Aaah! Help!</i>

151
00:11:28,805 --> 00:11:31,113
Hey, you evil monster!

152
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:33,240
Keep your hands off Colette!

153
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:34,153
What?!

154
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:36,340
Hey squirt, watching without paying, are you?

155
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:37,560
What nerve!

156
00:11:40,260 --> 00:11:41,660
Aha, found you!

157
00:11:41,740 --> 00:11:42,740
I'm sorry.

158
00:11:42,889 --> 00:11:45,480
Watching for free is the first step toward becoming a thief!

159
00:11:45,655 --> 00:11:48,079
But I didn't have any pocket money with me.

160
00:11:48,435 --> 00:11:50,286
I'll give you this dagger if you let me watch.

161
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:51,126
Okay?

162
00:11:51,729 --> 00:11:54,940
Whoa, it's covered in diamonds!

163
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:58,740
Sure, sure! Go right ahead and watch from the front row!

164
00:11:58,840 --> 00:11:59,840
Huh? Who's that?

165
00:12:01,695 --> 00:12:04,533
Aha! Prince Sapphire, I've finally found you!

166
00:12:04,558 --> 00:12:05,628
...A prince?

167
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:09,460
Giving away the royal dagger just to watch a puppet show...

168
00:12:09,615 --> 00:12:11,140
Come now, let's return to the castle.

169
00:12:11,270 --> 00:12:12,330
Come along with me.

170
00:12:12,354 --> 00:12:13,000
No!

171
00:12:13,025 --> 00:12:13,780
Don't "no" me!

172
00:12:13,804 --> 00:12:15,720
You're going to be severely punished for this!

173
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:16,540
No!

174
00:12:16,780 --> 00:12:17,360
No!

175
00:12:17,420 --> 00:12:17,540
No!

176
00:12:17,541 --> 00:12:20,380
If you don't listen, I'm telling your mother!

177
00:12:21,139 --> 00:12:23,380
"Prince," huh? But wow, what a dagger.

178
00:12:23,715 --> 00:12:25,366
That must be worth a million yen!

179
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:29,840
Hey, you know what it's like inside the castle, don't you?

180
00:12:30,139 --> 00:12:31,526
Yeah, but why?

181
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:34,780
Come on, tell me all about the inside of the castle.

182
00:12:34,908 --> 00:12:38,146
Like the grand interior, and the prince's room.

183
00:12:38,310 --> 00:12:40,606
Ah, how wonderful that would be.

184
00:12:40,859 --> 00:12:44,040
If you tell me, I'll show you the puppet show for free.

185
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:45,760
Really?

186
00:12:45,929 --> 00:12:47,913
But why do you want to know about the castle?

187
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:49,859
Because I just do, that's why!

188
00:12:50,335 --> 00:12:54,100
Tell me, and Colette will give you a special kiss.

189
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:55,880
Come on, deal?

190
00:12:56,445 --> 00:12:57,445
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

191
00:13:12,089 --> 00:13:15,920
Thanks to that runt, I've got the castle layout figured out.

192
00:13:16,625 --> 00:13:19,940
Alright, the prince's room is over there.

193
00:13:28,410 --> 00:13:30,126
I finally found it!

194
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:42,260
That worked like a charm.

195
00:13:42,410 --> 00:13:44,300
Now we'll be rich!

196
00:13:44,425 --> 00:13:48,260
I'll buy you a nice place, too. Ah, you little runt...

197
00:13:49,510 --> 00:13:50,700
Who are you calling a runt?!

198
00:13:50,990 --> 00:13:53,293
How dare you make Colette steal!

199
00:13:53,579 --> 00:13:55,506
Shut up! Get lost!

200
00:13:55,638 --> 00:13:56,411
No way!

201
00:13:56,775 --> 00:13:58,013
You old fool!

202
00:13:58,205 --> 00:14:00,126
You have to give the dagger back to Sapphire!

203
00:14:01,179 --> 00:14:02,100
W-What's that?

204
00:14:03,020 --> 00:14:03,520
Who's there?!

205
00:14:03,680 --> 00:14:04,680
Show yourself!

206
00:14:04,954 --> 00:14:07,400
Hey! I dropped the dagger we worked so hard to get!

207
00:14:07,500 --> 00:14:08,560
Look what you've done!

208
00:14:08,859 --> 00:14:09,835
What are you talking about?

209
00:14:09,860 --> 00:14:10,961
You're the one who was stealing!

210
00:14:10,985 --> 00:14:11,600
What did you say?!

211
00:14:11,640 --> 00:14:13,180
Who’s making all that noise out there?!

212
00:14:15,335 --> 00:14:18,900
You're not getting away! Wait!

213
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:21,920
Alright, I won't let you escape!

214
00:14:25,569 --> 00:14:27,440
You're going back to Sapphire to apologize!

215
00:14:27,605 --> 00:14:31,106
And besides, making Colette do things like stealing is just... well, it's just wrong!

216
00:14:32,793 --> 00:14:34,933
Looks like we've got a thief here.

217
00:14:37,530 --> 00:14:39,666
What were you doing in a place like this?

218
00:14:41,775 --> 00:14:43,853
Please forgive me!

219
00:14:44,070 --> 00:14:47,620
I'll do anything to make amends! My, my, what an unusual thief.

220
00:14:47,795 --> 00:14:49,600
Please, spare me!

221
00:14:50,615 --> 00:14:53,273
Ooh, I just had a great idea.

222
00:14:53,405 --> 00:14:54,520
Hey, old man!

223
00:14:55,369 --> 00:14:58,686
Do as I say if you don't want your head chopped off!

224
00:15:01,234 --> 00:15:02,640
Don't listen to him!

225
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:03,593
He's definitely up to no—

226
00:15:03,617 --> 00:15:04,621
Shut up!

227
00:15:13,749 --> 00:15:16,160
Hmph, serves you right! I'm locking you up and never letting you out!

228
00:15:16,400 --> 00:15:17,400
No!

229
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:18,560
Now, old man!

230
00:15:18,620 --> 00:15:19,620
You're coming with me!

231
00:15:21,833 --> 00:15:25,146
Old Man Anzoro, you mustn't listen to what Nylon says!

232
00:15:25,529 --> 00:15:28,860
He's definitely plotting something bad against Sapphire!

233
00:15:34,189 --> 00:15:35,100
Huh, really?

234
00:15:35,160 --> 00:15:36,400
Putting on a puppet show at the castle?

235
00:15:36,700 --> 00:15:41,420
Absolutely! It's a special event I, Nylon, have arranged for you, Prince Sapphire!

236
00:15:41,635 --> 00:15:43,160
Yahoo!

237
00:15:43,489 --> 00:15:45,848
Everything is ready in the courtyard...

238
00:15:54,039 --> 00:15:55,780
We will now begin.

239
00:15:56,289 --> 00:15:58,888
The title of the play is "The Tomboy Princess."

240
00:15:58,912 --> 00:16:00,265
Wow, that sounds like fun!

241
00:16:00,290 --> 00:16:01,290
Hurry up and start!

242
00:16:02,229 --> 00:16:05,580
It'll be quite a sight to see the looks on Sapphire and the Queen's faces when they watch this play.

243
00:16:05,810 --> 00:16:08,840
After all, I stayed up all night coming up with this story.

244
00:16:12,049 --> 00:16:15,601
<i>Once again, our tomboy princess skips her lessons to go play in the forest.</i>

245
00:16:15,625 --> 00:16:17,780
Oh my, she's dressed just like a boy!

246
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:24,673
Hey, aren't you done yet?

247
00:16:24,925 --> 00:16:26,820
We have to go save Sapphire.

248
00:16:27,305 --> 00:16:30,360
Nylon is definitely up to something evil using little Colette.

249
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:33,560
<i>En garde!</i>

250
00:16:33,640 --> 00:16:34,040
<i>En garde!</i>

251
00:16:34,460 --> 00:16:34,880
<i>How beautiful you are!</i>

252
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:36,080
<i>Princess Tomboy!</i>

253
00:16:36,285 --> 00:16:37,285
<i>What do you want, Vinyl?!</i>

254
00:16:37,615 --> 00:16:40,100
<i>You're a girl, Princess, so please wear a cute dress.</i>

255
00:16:40,280 --> 00:16:40,540
<i>No way!</i>

256
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,140
<i>No way!</i>

257
00:16:43,800 --> 00:16:44,580
<i>Forgive me!</i>

258
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:45,240
<i>Forgive me!</i>

259
00:16:45,439 --> 00:16:48,475
<i>Look, I'm a boy! Got that?</i>

260
00:16:49,649 --> 00:16:54,140
<i>Oh, I worry about the Princess so much. Why does she lie and say she's a boy?</i>

261
00:16:54,350 --> 00:16:56,180
<i>My heart aches.</i>

262
00:17:02,599 --> 00:17:06,153
Mother, this must be a scheme by Duralumin and Nylon.

263
00:17:06,384 --> 00:17:07,940
Please, just act normal.

264
00:17:08,482 --> 00:17:08,915
But...

265
00:17:09,393 --> 00:17:11,640
<i>Princess, why are you lying about being a boy?</i>

266
00:17:11,889 --> 00:17:13,665
<i>Besides, they keep telling me to become king,</i>

267
00:17:13,689 --> 00:17:16,420
<i>and I can just chop off the heads of anyone I don't like! Yah!</i>

268
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:17,565
Stop!

269
00:17:17,839 --> 00:17:19,180
Sapphire isn't that kind of girl!

270
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:20,920
Mother...

271
00:17:21,489 --> 00:17:23,174
What's wrong, your Majesty?

272
00:17:23,199 --> 00:17:25,500
Do you not care for this puppet show?

273
00:17:26,009 --> 00:17:27,640
Sapphire looks pale, too.

274
00:17:27,744 --> 00:17:29,480
Maybe we should call it off.

275
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:30,326
I'm fine!

276
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:31,440
Keep going!

277
00:17:32,439 --> 00:17:33,980
The Queen seems to be suffering quite a bit.

278
00:17:34,129 --> 00:17:37,580
She'll surely confess Sapphire is a girl any moment now. Ha!

279
00:17:37,759 --> 00:17:39,620
Then I can finally become king!

280
00:17:40,134 --> 00:17:43,900
Bad people like you will be eaten by the King of Hell, Lord Enma!

281
00:17:44,519 --> 00:17:47,200
Enma or whatever, I don't care! I'm not scared!

282
00:17:47,554 --> 00:17:48,760
I'll beat them all up!

283
00:17:55,860 --> 00:17:56,860
Stop it!

284
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:57,964
Mother...

285
00:17:57,988 --> 00:17:58,901
Please stop!

286
00:17:59,429 --> 00:18:00,780
I feel so sorry for Sapphire.

287
00:18:01,565 --> 00:18:02,565
I'm fine.

288
00:18:02,734 --> 00:18:05,440
Look, Mother, isn't that just a show?

289
00:18:07,839 --> 00:18:09,780
I am the Demon of Hell!

290
00:18:10,009 --> 00:18:12,093
Where is that lying tomboy?!

291
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:13,280
There you are!

292
00:18:14,485 --> 00:18:16,753
I'm going to eat you up!

293
00:18:17,493 --> 00:18:17,966
Huh?

294
00:18:18,059 --> 00:18:19,080
I'll eat you up!

295
00:18:19,120 --> 00:18:19,500
Eat you!

296
00:18:19,620 --> 00:18:20,040
Eat you!

297
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:20,600
Damn it!

298
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:21,460
Eat you!

299
00:18:21,469 --> 00:18:24,173
It stopped moving!

300
00:18:26,679 --> 00:18:28,699
I am a real demon!

301
00:18:29,034 --> 00:18:30,920
One snap and I won't move anymore!

302
00:18:31,259 --> 00:18:33,686
The puppet is moving on its own!

303
00:18:34,369 --> 00:18:35,793
You villains!

304
00:18:36,109 --> 00:18:39,220
I've come to defeat you!

305
00:18:39,840 --> 00:18:40,113
Oh!

306
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:41,200
Colette!

307
00:18:41,332 --> 00:18:42,915
I'm on your side!

308
00:18:42,940 --> 00:18:43,766
He's here!

309
00:18:43,860 --> 00:18:45,600
It's the real Lord Enma!

310
00:18:46,120 --> 00:18:46,695
Hey!

311
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:47,380
Anzoro!

312
00:18:47,700 --> 00:18:48,566
Yes!

313
00:18:48,949 --> 00:18:51,961
No more evil deeds for you!

314
00:18:51,986 --> 00:18:54,380
Forgive us! We'll never do bad things again!

315
00:18:54,660 --> 00:18:55,740
I'm outta here!

316
00:19:12,949 --> 00:19:13,616
Wait!

317
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:14,395
Hey, you brat!

318
00:19:14,420 --> 00:19:16,646
How dare you ruin my play!

319
00:19:16,764 --> 00:19:17,764
Stop the carriage!

320
00:19:17,820 --> 00:19:18,820
Thief!

321
00:19:31,684 --> 00:19:32,880
Running is useless!

322
00:19:32,999 --> 00:19:34,940
I'll burn you all to ashes!

323
00:19:58,120 --> 00:19:58,800
Serves you right!

324
00:19:58,929 --> 00:20:00,300
Burn to death, all of you!

325
00:20:02,979 --> 00:20:04,080
My puppets!

326
00:20:04,340 --> 00:20:05,500
My puppets!

327
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:18,860
Colette!

328
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:20,153
Colette!

329
00:20:24,469 --> 00:20:25,906
We have to escape somehow!

330
00:21:05,299 --> 00:21:10,200
My dear Colette, and all my other puppets... will I never see you again?

331
00:21:10,593 --> 00:21:13,261
Thinking of it, my tears overflow like a waterfall,

332
00:21:15,572 --> 00:21:22,481
and now everything I see looks like a puppet to me...My beloved dolls! But it has all vanished like bubbles,

333
00:21:22,512 --> 00:21:25,840
for my own wickedness has brought this punishment.

334
00:21:26,509 --> 00:21:28,959
Oh well, I'm going to sleep.

335
00:21:28,983 --> 00:21:29,759
 Colette

336
00:21:32,040 --> 00:21:34,280
Don't worry, Old Man Anzoro, it's Colette.

337
00:21:34,599 --> 00:21:36,880
Oh, you're right! It's Colette!

338
00:21:39,059 --> 00:21:40,940
Huh, did you catch a cold?

339
00:21:41,100 --> 00:21:46,360
No, I'm just soaked because the carriage fell in the river, that's all.

340
00:21:48,559 --> 00:21:50,700
Old Man, did you miss me?

341
00:21:50,701 --> 00:21:56,320
Oh, yes, very much. Just seeing you in a dream makes me so happy.

342
00:21:56,669 --> 00:21:58,980
Oh, but I'm no dream!

343
00:21:59,080 --> 00:21:59,720
Not a dream?

344
00:22:00,024 --> 00:22:01,700
Oh! So that means...

345
00:22:02,719 --> 00:22:06,960
Oh, it's the real Little Red! Ah, you're safe!

346
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:11,460
Sheesh, pulling me so suddenly... That was mean, Old Man!

347
00:22:12,455 --> 00:22:18,660
Sorry, sorry. I was just so happy. Did you save Colette, young man?

348
00:22:19,339 --> 00:22:22,740
Yep! And all the other puppets, too!

349
00:22:28,412 --> 00:22:31,820
I... I've never been so happy in my whole life!

350
00:22:32,079 --> 00:22:34,391
You can't do anything bad anymore, okay?

351
00:22:34,415 --> 00:22:37,800
Oh, I definitely—probably—won't ever steal again!

352
00:22:38,099 --> 00:22:41,540
To prove it, I'll put on a puppet show for free!

353
00:22:42,229 --> 00:22:43,229
Wow, really?

354
00:22:43,849 --> 00:22:46,206
You can come on out now, kiddo!

355
00:22:46,594 --> 00:22:48,760
He says he'll show us even if we don't have money!

356
00:22:49,494 --> 00:22:52,180
Step right up for Old Man Anzoro's puppet show!

357
00:22:52,334 --> 00:22:53,680
It's going to be a lot of fun!

358
00:22:56,179 --> 00:22:58,540
Aww, it really is cute!

359
00:23:04,695 --> 00:23:06,060
It's that monster again!

360
00:23:06,179 --> 00:23:07,320
Hold it right there!

361
00:23:07,459 --> 00:23:09,159
Take that, you brute!

362
00:23:09,219 --> 00:23:11,540
Keep picking on them and you'll have to deal with me!

363
00:23:13,439 --> 00:23:14,860
Tink, what are you doing?

364
00:23:15,139 --> 00:23:16,220
How do you like that?!

365
00:23:16,334 --> 00:23:18,626
Wow, Tink! Looking good!

366
00:23:20,059 --> 00:23:25,020
Oh no, right at the best part! That's all for today.

367
00:23:27,919 --> 00:23:30,185
See you all next week!

